      "branch": "studio/policy-engine-scoping",
      "note": "The engine's integer policyVersion is unrelated to the corpus semver; the corpus version, commit, and file digests live only in this sidecar."
    },
    {
      "field": "project-local preamble",
      "branch": "studio/policy-engine-scoping",
      "note": "The compiled AGENTS.md replaces the whole file, so Hindsight's project-specific reading order (.app-factory/project.json, quality/quality-manifest.json, Docs/*) has no home in the compiled authority; it belongs in the project manifest or a nested AGENTS.md scope."
    },
    {
      "field": "copilot adapter",
      "branch": "studio/policy-engine-scoping",
      "note": "The corpus lists .github/copilot-instructions.md as a supported entry point but PolicyClient and ProjectManifestV1.rules.clientEntrypoints.client do not include copilot; an existing copilot adapter stays bound to the pre-bundle AGENTS.md digest and trips rules.adapter-nonconforming plus rules.conflicting-declaration until it is regenerated or removed."
    }
